  Class: 21
  Name: Honeyguide
  Description: Two seats, one hull, like the honeyguide bird and the honey badger it leads.
    The Honeyguide flies the hull and rides trails: touch a trail of a domain the battery holds,
    nose along it, and slip to its end. The Ratel plays the Dynamo, a hex puzzle: every pattern
    made charges the battery and fires its own card. D-pad left or right swaps seats; the AI
    takes the empty one.
